    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d371">

                <pb facs="0531" n="411" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg411"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-29"><hi rendition="#italic">December 29,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your cable December 29.</p>
                <p>Instructions in my cable of December 6<anchor n="a" xml:id="d371-f1"/> should be
                    followed strictly. In that case there will be no landing of troops under any
                    such circumstances as to justify apprehension of danger to lives of
                    foreigners.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
